#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:81
#: 1621e6a4a17c4ec9bc83491a258ffe77
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:83
#: 91b3cc13715a4fa0a3ec7e0b0b1c8ae5
msgid ""
"The default RC input is SBUS only on SBUS pin. PPM is not supported. Other "
"RC protocols must use another UART port such as UART1 or UART4, and set its "
"protocol to receive RC data: ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL=23`` and change "
":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` to something other than its "
"default protocol of '23'. If using CRSF/ELRS, UART1 should be used since it "
"has full DMA. If using another UART for RC input:"
msgstr ""
"默认 RC 输入仅通过 SBUS 引脚接收 SBUS 信号，不支持 PPM。其他 RC 协议必须使用其他 UART 端口（如 UART1 或 "
"UART4），并将其协议设为接收 RC 数据：``SERIALx_PROTOCOL=23``，同时将 "
":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 更改为非默认的「23」协议。如果使用 CRSF/ELRS，建议使用 "
"UART1（支持完整 DMA）。如果使用另一个 UART 作为 RC 输入："

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:85
#: fb5d188ce3014bcaa3a13dae4bb2839a
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to the TX of the UART and ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` be "
"set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需连接至 UART 的 TX 引脚，并将 ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` 设为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:87
#: bcac1d4821164447903f344dc0793972
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX connection, and automatically provides telemetry. "
"Set ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` to \"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF 还需 TX 连接，并自动提供数传。请将 ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` 设为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:89
#: 7f686ec7b6d149709242db0d8eb7c326
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" ``SERIALx_OPTIONS>`` to \"4\"."
msgstr "SRXL2 需连接至 TX 并自动提供数传。请将 ``SERIALx_OPTIONS>`` 设为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:92
#: 52e1d8d0421d4291a1e3d74ddea14557
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:94
#: a11412cea6c64795a4a092e0e320ff85
msgid ""
"The MicoAir405v2 supports analog OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver) using"
" the CAM and VTX connectors. DisplayPort HD OSD via the DJI connector is "
"enabled simultaneously by :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5."
msgstr ""
"MicoAir405v2 通过 CAM 和 VTX 接头支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的模拟 OSD。DisplayPort "
"高清 OSD 通过 DJI 接头同时启用，由 :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5 控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:97
#: e0940710ea6442c2ac023c377bbe878a
msgid "HD VTX Support"
msgstr "高清图传支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:99
#: b4de527dc4c14d41856a3788b10c86c5
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection. Pin 1 of "
"the connector is 9v so be careful not to connect this to a peripheral "
"requiring 5v."
msgstr "SH1.0-6P 接头支持标准 DJI 高清图传连接。接头的第 1 针为 9V，请勿将其连接到需要 5V 的外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:102
#: 09479435a3674223a13dcd4f817cd295
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:104
#: 477b7b5ccdef420f879c1c2e5e758f56
msgid ""
"The MicoAir405v2 supports up to 10 PWM outputs(Mini supports 9). Outputs 1-8"
" also support DShot. Outputs 1-4 support bi-directional DShot. Outputs are "
"grouped and each group must use the same output protocol:"
msgstr ""
"MicoAir405v2 最多支持 10 路 PWM 输出（Mini 支持 9 路）。输出 1-8 另外支持 DShot，输出 1-4 支持双向 "
"DShot。输出按组划分，每组必须使用相同的输出协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:106
#: aeab699b74204fc5948594f02a1625e5
msgid "1,2,5,6 are group1"
msgstr "1、2、5、6 属于第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:107
#: 614bdbd8f5db4c8a812141485e980090
msgid "3, 4 are group 2"
msgstr "3、4 属于第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:108
#: 8c89409650664de49c94e56857c78ebd
msgid "7,8 are group 3"
msgstr "7、8 属于第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:109
#: f32692dcc123487dbafcd285319f1e96
msgid "9,10 are in group 4"
msgstr "9、10 属于第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:111
#: c69cec6978a54e58acb6287e698e26da
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从BetaflightX机架迁移的用户，前四路输出M1-M4已配置为使用现有电机接线，默认参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:113
#: 972520c272544b8596b7dc55cfe1beaf
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:114
#: e778a63318e8423baf1fa1f8f7dd869e
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:117
