msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir405v2.rst:135
#: c7038eb9eea6465995c4b1c31b4155b6
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"MicoAir405v2\" "
